#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:5
#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:6
#: 01902ac5176c4658a9c9334413d801a7 9479d4d37c3e4390b58f8be320eeb85f
#: bf04702e73bd44768c71ec0b873e035b c4074ea5e00c43f5921b054aff5f3089
#: ed64fb69c44b4f34a41e50a100048212
msgid "Gimbal / Mount Controls"
msgstr "云台/挂载控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:8
#: 271361b8a4a446f7a7192c1d42200fbd
msgid ""
"Camera gimbals (aka camera mounts) can be controlled in at least six "
"different ways.  This page provides an overview of these controls and their "
"setup."
msgstr "相机云台（也称为相机挂载）可通过至少六种不同方式进行控制。本页提供这些控制方式的概述及其设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:10
#: 897aec3985664fac93984f64655761c1
msgid ""
"The gimbal's \"mode\" defines how it is controlled.  Each ground station "
"(GCS) is different but Mission Planner, for example, has a \"Set Mount\" "
"button that allows changing the mode.  In many cases the user does not need "
"to directly set the mode, instead this is done automatically as part of "
"responding to a command from the user."
msgstr ""
"云台的「模式」定义了其控制方式。各地面站有所不同，以 Mission Planner 为例，它有一个「Set "
"Mount」按钮，可用于更改模式。在许多情况下，用户无需直接设置模式，而是作为响应用户命令的一部分自动完成的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:16
#: 67b3b603f1fa4dce81834c0fde46e6e7
msgid "Below are the 6 supported modes."
msgstr "以下是 6 种支持的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:18
#: 171cc4b1902349e895a146f9f918b649
msgid ""
"Retract Mode: the gimbal will move to the roll, pitch and yaw angles held in"
" the :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`, :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`"
" parameters respectively.  Some special gimbal specific behaviours:"
msgstr ""
"收回模式：云台将移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`"
" 参数中分别保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。部分特定云台的特殊行为如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:20
#: b6565f4e916b42c7954946f822be4fcd
msgid ""
":ref:`Gremsy gimbals <common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal>` will immediately stop "
"stabilising"
msgstr ":ref:`Gremsy 云台 <common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal>` 将立即停止稳定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:21
#: f385585632824aa8820407cdeca7d280
msgid ""
":ref:`Servo gimbal <common-camera-gimbal>` will move to the specified angles"
" and stop stabilising.  If a retract servo has been set (e.g. "
":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` = 9 (Mount1Retract)) this servo "
"will move to its minimum position"
msgstr ""
":ref:`舵机云台 <common-camera-gimbal>` 将移动到指定角度并停止稳定。如果已设置收回舵机（例如 "
":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` = 9（Mount1Retract）），该舵机将移动到最小位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:22
#: 484c84e054d9404c9a4bb8db447e78fb
msgid ""
":ref:`Siyi gimbals <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` do not provide roll control so"
" the roll angle (:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`) is ignored"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Siyi 云台 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` "
"不提供横滚控制，因此横滚角度（:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`）将被忽略"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:24
#: 40c4ba83e346460cbf6237d98a52a93d
msgid ""
"Neutral Mode: the gimbal will move to the roll, pitch and yaw angles held in"
" the :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`, :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`"
" respectively"
msgstr ""
"中立模式：云台将分别移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`"
" 中保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:26
#: 9a05852d7e8c4633a240355db3af6a44
msgid ""
"MAVLink Targeting: the gimbal will move according to real-time commands "
"received from the ground stations, companion computers or other MAVLink "
"command source, and/or Auto mode mission commands"
msgstr "MAVLink 定向：云台将根据从地面站、伴飞计算机或其他 MAVLink 命令源实时接收的命令，以及/或 Auto 模式任务命令进行移动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:28
#: aff6e218d9234bf4b449e471c5c8ca18
msgid ""
"RC Targeting: the pilot controls the gimbal in real-time using the RC "
"transmitter"
msgstr "RC 定向：飞手使用遥控器实时控制云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:30
#: 8edec7cd04d9417ab8141d2c74efc459
msgid ""
"GPS Point: same as MAVLink targeting but the gimbal points at a specific "
"location.  Users never need to actively set the gimbal to this mode"
msgstr "GPS 定点：与 MAVLink 定向相同，但云台指向特定位置。用户无需主动将云台设置为此模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:32
#: 4c9aed97a8634e9f825fff29e1db539f
msgid ""
"SysId Target: the gimbal points at another vehicle with the MAVLink system "
"id specified.  Users never need to actively set the gimbal to this mode and "
"there are no known GCSs that support setting the system id, but the "
"parameter can be set by updating the value of "
":ref:`MNT1_SYSID_DFLT<MNT1_SYSID_DFLT>` directly."
msgstr ""
"SysId 定向：云台指向具有指定 MAVLink 系统 ID 的另一飞行器。用户无需主动将云台设置为此模式，也没有已知的 GCS 支持设置系统 "
"ID，但可以通过直接更新 :ref:`MNT1_SYSID_DFLT<MNT1_SYSID_DFLT>` 的值来设置该参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:34
#: ee20729598574f4c8bcf0cd1e050c6f1
msgid ""
"Home Location: the gimbal points at home (normally its takeoff location)"
msgstr "Home 位置：云台指向 Home 点（通常为起飞位置）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:36
#: 975e87fd15a9428a9d2ce9514de1c37b
msgid ""
"The gimbal's default mode on startup can be set with the "
":ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>` parameter."
msgstr "云台启动时的默认模式可通过 :ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>` 参数设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:38
#: 2abd062beac24b67978f728e81ba2bc7
msgid ""
"ArduPilot 4.5 (and higher) automatically switches the gimbal to RC Targeting"
" Mode if the pilot moves any configured Roll/Pitch/Yaw RC targeting inputs "
"(see below) by the larger of 10uS or ``RCx_DZ``.  The only exception is if "
"the gimbals is in RETRACT mode in which case the gimbal mode will not be "
"automatically changed."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 4.5（及更高版本）会在飞手移动任何已配置的横滚/俯仰/偏航 RC 定向输入（见下文）超过 10µs 或 ``RCx_DZ`` "
"中较大值时，自动将云台切换到 RC 定向模式。唯一的例外是云台处于 RETRACT 模式时，此时云台模式不会被自动更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:41
#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:61
#: 25252d64e340430687fa9322ab3c1bd3 329d6eb026434fb6a6e38e3cdf143fd0
#: c32d4e6b535d4c05aae7bacf6aa25b04 c6054514991f46d4a364c26c12fcf059
#: ee27dfae0c764ca9ba5aafac55ca67f5
msgid "Control with an RC transmitter (aka RC Targeting)"
msgstr "使用遥控器控制（RC 定向）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:43
#: 832302de326d41a0aeabeec4c9b20204
msgid ""
"While the gimbal is in \"RC Targeting\" mode (see above for how to change "
"modes), the pilot can control the gimbal's target roll, pitch and yaw angles"
" using an RC transmitter channel for each axis. For example (RC channels "
"shown are for example only, and can be any channel not otherwise used):"
msgstr ""
"当云台处于「RC 定向」模式时（更改模式的方法见上文），飞手可以为每个轴分配一个 RC 通道来控制云台的目标横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。例如（所示 RC "
"通道仅为示例，可使用任何未被占用的通道）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:45
#: feb96b9ec6b54ec7955411999d6d6950
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 212 (\"Mount1 Roll\") to control the "
"gimbal's roll angle with RC channel 6"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 212（「Mount1 Roll」），通过 RC 通道 6 控制云台横滚角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:46
#: e8f6360cc6ee49a38af89a53e035c9d3
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount1 Pitch\") to control the "
"gimbal's pitch angle with RC channel 7"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 213（「Mount1 Pitch」），通过 RC 通道 7 控制云台俯仰角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:47
#: f73697226f28402299f6855b55a17ab3
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount1 Yaw\") to control the "
"gimbal's yaw angle with RC channel 8"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 214（「Mount1 Yaw」），通过 RC 通道 8 控制云台偏航角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:48
#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:67
#: 0ddbf8cc0a624e93842d8c5fcc3905c9 13fe3ee5e7b64ba6b621a1af46876f29
#: 3b45f6ddfa424bd883889a06f7db9baf e1e21077b9eb439abf7587e8352af280
#: f9fadee3879d403ba0c550e8c37a099f
msgid ""
"ensure the RCx_TRIM parameter for each RC input channel used is half way "
"between RCx_MIN and RCx_MAX"
msgstr "确保每个已使用 RC 输入通道的 RCx_TRIM 参数设置在 RCx_MIN 和 RCx_MAX 的中间"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:50
#: a4ccc758fcb64466b56080c63ed6b938
msgid ""
"By default the RC input specifies the **angle** but this can be changed to "
"**rate** control by setting :ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to the "
"desired rotation rate in deg/sec."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下 RC 输入指定的是 **角度**，但可以通过将 :ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` "
"设置为所需旋转速率（度/秒）来改为 **速率** 控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:52
#: ef00ffbac6b74677ab2bbe9dc7fb4759
msgid ""
"By default the yaw control is in \"follow\" mode (aka \"body frame\") "
"meaning that the gimbal's heading will rotate as the vehicle rotates.  The "
"alternative is \"lock\" mode (aka \"earth frame\") meaning the gimbal's "
"heading will stay locked onto a particular heading regardless of the "
"vehicle's yaw.  The pilot can switch between these two modes with an "
"auxiliary switch."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，偏航控制处于「跟随」模式（又称「机体坐标系」），即云台朝向随飞行器旋转而旋转。另一种是「锁定」模式（又称「地球坐标系」），即无论飞行器偏航如何变化，云台朝向都保持锁定在特定航向上。飞手可以通过辅助开关在这两种模式之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:54
#: b4e526b2fde7484798a5c5795a76a816
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 163 (\"Mount Lock\") to switch between "
"\"lock\", or yaw lock in earth-frame when switched to high, and \"follow\" "
"mode or body frame yaw  with RC channel 9"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 163（「Mount Lock」），通过 RC 通道 9 "
"在「锁定」（高位时锁定为地球坐标系偏航）和「跟随」（机体坐标系偏航）模式之间切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:56
#: 85365a8a2b2a4ca8a8c4669cc6aefd25
msgid ""
"normally, the yaw lock will revert to \"follow\" mode on any targeting mode "
"change. Then ``MNTx_OPTIONS`` bit 0, when set will allow the yaw lock mode "
"to persist until changed by RC switch or MAVLink command."
msgstr ""
"通常情况下，偏航锁定在任何定向模式改变时会恢复为「跟随」模式。设置 ``MNTx_OPTIONS`` 的第 0 位后，偏航锁定模式将持续保持，直到通过 "
"RC 开关或 MAVLink 命令更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:58
#: 0d8fbcdb8f3b4d108cfd9bc04ef22aea
msgid ""
"The pilot can retract the gimbal with the \"Retract Mount1\" or \"Retract "
"Mount2\" auxiliary switch"
msgstr "飞手可以通过「Retract Mount1」或「Retract Mount2」辅助开关收回云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:60
#: a276be690fab44e7b4b20ea2faf609e3
msgid ""
":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 27 (\"Retract Mount1\") to change the "
"gimbal to Retract mode"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 27（「Retract Mount1」），将云台切换到收回模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:61
#: 705f5de9ebdf4e1f91eb9dca0346a2d6
msgid ""
":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 113 (\"Retract Mount2\") to change the "
"gimbal to Retract mode"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 113（「Retract Mount2」），将云台切换到收回模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:64
#: 4df4c623b7324a03a966b68047fe51c0
msgid "Mission Planner Gimbal Controls"
msgstr "Mission Planner 云台控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:66
#: 31d0273aad974c92bb4ef22bf0d47608
msgid ""
"Mission Planner uses MAVLink commands to control the gimbal.  The gimbal's "
"angles can be controlled as follows"
msgstr "Mission Planner 使用 MAVLink 命令控制云台。云台角度可按如下方式控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:121
#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:68
#: 576b173e53804cbdaf5094b042b01df2 7d1e898d23f44f30a1c791a13014c97d
#: 7d5af461c81147578657000e865e6078 ab1117f8482f497b84054af64bca6287
#: e01b9711af1741cb84d700513b329ee0
msgid ""
"Set the mode to \"MAVLink Targeting\" using the Data screen's Actions tab's "
"bottom left drop-down and then push the \"Set Mount\" button (see image "
"above)"
msgstr ""
"在 Data 界面的 Actions 选项卡左下角下拉菜单中将模式设置为「MAVLink Targeting」，然后点击「Set "
"Mount」按钮（见上图）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:69
#: 3bdcf683ef9245f6bc36b31f228f168f
msgid ""
"Use the Payload Control tab to adjust the gimbal's roll, pitch or yaw angles"
msgstr "使用 Payload Control 选项卡调整云台的横滚、俯仰或偏航角度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:128
#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:75
#: 2c2a180e1ec24fa98baa136d71f1287a 4cc69e4bc4f64554a1950044a3b0d427
#: 6aec14c2ccf5403faf814267196cba78 7cac6922432341acaabde9c0055aad52
#: e473ad25072a4e2da65f6fc75d1144de
msgid ""
"Use the Aux Function tab to switch the yaw between \"follow\" and \"lock\" "
"modes"
msgstr "使用 Aux Function 选项卡在「跟随」和「锁定」模式之间切换偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:80
#: 6729022a956d4f8ca2310adfb4cb64f3
msgid ""
"To point the gimbal at a particular location (e.g. lat, lon, alt), on the "
"Data screen, right-mouse-button click on the map and select, \"Point Camera "
"Here\" and enter an altitude above home"
msgstr ""
"要将云台指向特定位置（如纬度、经度、高度），在 Data 界面右键单击地图并选择「Point Camera Here」，然后输入相对 Home 点的高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:86
#: 2a2e183c1d154db398b8cfbafb462922
msgid "QGC Gimbal Controls"
msgstr "QGroundControl 云台控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:88
#: 56e46f8ba0cb4ac4afd4de5ceb64c69f
msgid ""
"`QGC-4.4 (and higher) "
"<https://github.com/mavlink/qgroundcontrol/releases>`__ supports controlling"
" the gimbal from a Toolbar or by directly clicking on the real-time video.  "
"The vehicle must be using ArduPilot 4.5 (or higher)"
msgstr ""
"`QGC-4.4（及更高版本） <https://github.com/mavlink/qgroundcontrol/releases>`__ "
"支持通过工具栏或直接点击实时视频来控制云台。飞行器必须使用 ArduPilot 4.5（或更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:90
#: 00e49d699eb9420a857646378743f67e
msgid ""
"The gimbal control toolbar should appear at the top once a gimbal is "
"detected.  Click on the toolbar to display the gimbal control buttons"
msgstr "检测到云台后，顶部应出现云台控制工具栏。点击工具栏显示云台控制按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:95
#: cf2cc39da16b454c8a66a89268bb3e5f
msgid ""
"\"Yaw Lock\" / \"Yaw Follow\" controls whether the gimbal maintains an "
"earth-frame yaw target (aka \"lock\") or moves with the vehicle's yaw (aka "
"\"follow\")"
msgstr "「Yaw Lock」/「Yaw Follow」控制云台是维持地球坐标系偏航目标（「锁定」）还是随飞行器偏航运动（「跟随」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:96
#: e0120f4a7bf14fc5a78c053d527da1cd
msgid ""
"\"Center\" centers the gimbal (or more precisely moves it to the roll, pitch"
" and yaw angles held in :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`)"
msgstr ""
"「Center」使云台居中（更准确地说是移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`"
" 中保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:97
#: 5db7666e07b14f43a94c990e91239b84
msgid "\"Tilt 90\" points the gimbal directly downwards"
msgstr "「Tilt 90」将云台直接朝下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:98
#: 2ca5c04ec2bb417c814eb85044c9cd0a
msgid "\"Point Home\" points the gimbal at the home location"
msgstr "「Point Home」将云台指向 Home 位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:99
#: 5eed0c109e274e6aba0af9915d323830
msgid ""
"\"Retract\" retracts the gimbal (or more precisely moves it to the roll, "
"pitch and yaw angles held in :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`)"
msgstr ""
"「Retract」收回云台（更准确地说是移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`"
" 中保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:101
#: fa150eb6b8cc4577aa97a7e036d783a0
msgid ""
"The gimbal may also be controlled by clicking on the real-time video screen"
msgstr "也可以通过点击实时视频画面来控制云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:103
#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:155
