msgstr "Auto 模式任务期间的控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:131
#: a40efd1107854095b97975ea83ed0e75
msgid ""
"Commands to control the gimbal are listed on the  :ref:`Camera Control in "
"Auto Missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`,"
" :ref:`Copter Mission Command List <mission-command-list>` and :ref:`Mission"
" Commands <common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` pages"
msgstr ""
"控制云台的命令列于 :ref:`Auto 任务中的相机控制 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-"
"mission-planner>`、:ref:`Copter 任务命令列表 <mission-command-list>` 和 :ref:`任务命令 "
"<common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:6
#: 0f20641d90c941ce8f1f3c441e609ece 4099d661c3d74f499503185ae917ce14
#: 7d2cc50e182043dda8327fef6df7ec42 dfab30d9b1e34129bb9540eea56ecf86
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides mechanisms to control the pointing direction (aka "
"targeting) automatically for camera mounts (know hereafter as ``mounts``), "
"as well as by pilot commands/controls. Mounts can be commanded point in at "
"least six different ways (``targeting modes``) by ArduPilot.  This page "
"provides an overview of these controls and their setup."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供了对相机云台（下文称 "
"``mounts``）的指向方向（即目标指向）进行自动控制的机制，也支持由飞手指令/操控。ArduPilot "
"可以以至少六种不同方式（``targeting modes``）指挥云台指向。本页概述这些控制及其设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:8
#: 75c352a5179c4ecc9fe9772c5fd6ceab 7b319f74801c4f27b525c25b3484f032
#: b35cab1fe5554fabaecc5efe59e9ba00 cd650d86db6d406a99b889ad6429c944
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports up to two mounts. Each mount has parameters associated "
"with it, e.g.  :ref:`MNT1_TYPE<MNT1_TYPE>`, :ref:`MNT2_TYPE<MNT2_TYPE>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE<MNT1_RC_RATE>`, :ref:`MNT2_RC_RATE<MNT2_RC_RATE>`, etc. "
"For the remainder of the article, we will use MNT1 for examples of setups "
"and parameters."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 最多支持两个云台。每个云台都有与之关联的参数，例如 "
":ref:`MNT1_TYPE<MNT1_TYPE>`、:ref:`MNT2_TYPE<MNT2_TYPE>`、:ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE<MNT1_RC_RATE>`、:ref:`MNT2_RC_RATE<MNT2_RC_RATE>`"
" 等。本文其余部分将以 MNT1 为例说明设置和参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:10
#: 01ed41a7e93f490b8b8e003061eddd03 43941f691d9c4a659c453ead194aa279
#: 796a5c62d49447508a084ccaca09cd1a f4305f3f7af748b9bc0f62298f18b1cf
msgid ""
"The mount's \"targeting mode\" defines how it is controlled.  Each ground "
"station (GCS) is different but Mission Planner, for example, has a \"Set "
"Mount\" button that allows changing the mode.  In many cases the user does "
"not need to directly set the mode, instead this is done automatically as "
"part of responding to a command from the user."
msgstr ""
"云台的“目标指向模式”定义了它的控制方式。各地面站（GCS）互不相同，例如 Mission Planner 有一个 “Set Mount” "
"按钮可用于更改模式。多数情况下用户无需直接设置该模式，它会在响应用户命令的过程中自动完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:16
#: 6813c4ffc1fd4efea753e8dcc0138408 845c83d5822c43ce9a9965aafe1cdc98
#: bed7ce0a5e36467fa1c16b71bc71d0c3 ff0a0500dc3842e3bc5db6247ca4ff7f
msgid ""
"In order to enable the mount, a :ref:`MNT1_TYPE<MNT1_TYPE>` must be selected"
" corresponding to the mount type. This will allow its mount parameters to be"
" seen."
msgstr "要启用云台，必须选择与云台类型对应的 :ref:`MNT1_TYPE<MNT1_TYPE>`。这样才能看到它的云台参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:19
#: 100881d57a144c99be451a950e093f87 3b477b18ff004d5ab1ca8986c3d02249
#: 6ec95f9be1ab4840bd0408bc37cbb9e1 fbe323acb84c455fb135a346de02b517
msgid "Targeting Modes"
msgstr "目标指向模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:20
#: 2d728c0fbb384502b8543d519d9faaf2 bad79da591364287b6dee40b4f79b562
#: c784361210fa41edb215c84f86d3715f d981b60d85f54aeaa5038c2c5d9a2c15
msgid "Below are the 6 supported targeting modes."
msgstr "以下是支持的 6 种目标指向模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:22
#: 0a3788e85d5d43ea825d0049efcaf934 35c2f309d92d47d3a22a5ca633ded77e
#: 79d98fd3621c4a1a8e4ce9fd558c2a1f e0eef1b19d7b43158652216fda57a9e4
msgid ""
"**Retract Mode:** the mount will move to the roll, pitch and yaw angles held"
" in the :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`, :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`"
" parameters respectively.  Some special mount specific behaviours:"
msgstr ""
"**收起模式（Retract Mode）：** 云台将分别移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`"
" 参数中保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。某些云台的特殊行为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:24
#: 41e8811704904954b4935249af60442a 54eae1283b7f4734b007d69deecf6097
#: cb0d76f6f5344d40aa8ef6704b104801 e9b7f593f0e946758897f74c41675d28
msgid ""
":ref:`Gremsy mounts <common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal>` will immediately stop "
"stabilising"
msgstr ":ref:`Gremsy 云台 <common-gremsy-pixyu-gimbal>` 将立即停止增稳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:25
#: 867423cf348840dbabc094eff44d8959 93da31c4415941eea23124aa77654a8c
#: be2d0e3d7c804863aba18e4fe7f545a8 cc87dd95daef40019135a01cefd92390
msgid ""
":ref:`Servo mount <common-camera-gimbal>` will move to the specified angles "
"and stop stabilising."
msgstr ":ref:`舵机云台 <common-camera-gimbal>` 将移动到指定角度并停止增稳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:26
#: 089559d06cd94656896988b6bcf439df 0fff43b0ad9f4735a4bc1670b910b00b
#: 2e1fede7a04243d8bab28992807afd22 a06c8e328aea47bcb93cd79116949bb9
msgid ""
":ref:`Siyi mounts <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` do not provide roll control so "
"the roll angle (:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`) is ignored."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Siyi 云台 <common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>` "
"不提供横滚控制，因此横滚角（:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`）会被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:28
#: 758701fec5394ca79c16e949ce66cd7a a36c35b5b1a6412d965f2e768044a59f
#: a906058eb68340428026a3d77a4b942b b4345c5c463c43c8a185b55ed7ec1609
msgid ""
"If a servo has been setup to mechanically deploy/retract the mount "
"(``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = 9 for MNT1, \"15\" for MNT2) it will be commanded to "
"retract the mount. Changing to another mode will command the servo to deploy"
" the mount."
msgstr ""
"如果已设置舵机用于机械展开/收起云台（MNT1 为 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = 9，MNT2 为 "
"\"15\"），则会命令该舵机收起云台。切换到其他模式时会命令舵机展开云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:30
#: 66dfa0f88a27457c92242f5443a8fa1c 686dbc952cef4f009f04c9e66030050c
#: 8623fbd5159c4cc5b7e3d3d0a58110e2 8dbc73ada6cf447fbd538c666b0e6e74
msgid ""
"**Neutral Mode:** the mount will move to the roll, pitch and yaw angles held"
" in the :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`, respectively."
msgstr ""
"**中立模式（Neutral Mode）：** 云台将分别移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`"
" 中保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:32
#: 0e2915f050a04d6d903d2abf10df4565 4d5e4ae1cfbc474db5cf760f73bb4840
#: c0263e51083d41c1804864f9100ffd98 e06c2592f34c44928e32196abbfe4fcc
msgid ""
"**MAVLink Targeting:** the mount will move according to real-time commands "
"received from the ground stations, companion computers or other MAVLink "
"command source, and/or Auto mode mission commands. See "
":ref:`mav_cmd_do_gimbal_manager_pitchyaw`."
msgstr ""
"**MAVLink 目标指向：** 云台将按照来自地面站、协同计算机或其他 MAVLink 命令源的实时命令，和/或 Auto 模式任务命令移动。参见 "
":ref:`mav_cmd_do_gimbal_manager_pitchyaw`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:34
#: 57f637f3b36646e6a9e4523e9533b117 59eb15036db243a4a6972db7df4b4ebd
#: 90b46a2bc8294327829866fb4f78a1cc bfd2f6c87fc54d69b401fce25f2e28df
msgid ""
"**RC Targeting:** the pilot controls the mount in real-time using the RC "
"transmitter. See section below for more information."
msgstr "**RC 目标指向：** 飞手使用遥控器实时控制云台。更多信息见下文章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:36
#: 04d196cfd257441696769471d470a212 41b32fb1683947f29768a3f5e61ab243
#: 9dc765797ce54dd68f6b3afc7a826cb7 dd3ecacaf9ef4a53b1a13c3931696a7a
msgid ""
"**GPS Point:** same as MAVLink targeting but ArduPilot forces the mount to "
"point at a specific location.  Users never need to actively set the mount to"
" this mode. The user usually selects a point and altitude on the GCS map and"
" selects a right click menu item to \"Point the camera here\"."
msgstr ""
"**GPS 点指向：** 与 MAVLink 目标指向相同，但 ArduPilot 会强制云台指向特定位置。用户从不需要主动将云台设为该模式。用户通常在"
" GCS 地图上选择一个点和高度，然后在右键菜单中选择“Point the camera here”（将相机指向此处）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:38
#: 1b4eb6d9ee3a4ef4a7c70d11a111a2a1 20c1abb934774170adf0cfd81b27898c
#: 3b46c184db824d529b32524742ef6648 9063f9f3271d495b8d1d105e0eab058e
msgid ""
"**SysId Target:** the mount points at another vehicle with the MAVLink "
"system id specified.  Users never need to actively set the mount to this "
"mode and there are no known GCSs that support setting the system id, but the"
" parameter can be set by updating the value of "
":ref:`MNT1_SYSID_DFLT<MNT1_SYSID_DFLT>` directly."
msgstr ""
"**SysId 目标：** 云台指向具有指定 MAVLink 系统 ID 的另一载具。用户从不需要主动将云台设为该模式，也没有已知的 GCS "
"支持设置该系统 ID，但可以通过直接修改 :ref:`MNT1_SYSID_DFLT<MNT1_SYSID_DFLT>` 的值来设置该参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:40
#: 2753877a0d794cc881fdf30672aca1a4 74d8752937d946f8ab5f7b412505858e
#: a5a6c7c4ff0e461aa540ee5085bf5e0b cbdabcb62abd49f1ab60eccd770a6021
msgid ""
"**Home Location:** the mount points at Home (normally its location when "
"armed, unless changed by the user in the GCS)"
msgstr "**Home 位置：** 云台指向 Home 点（通常为解锁时的位置，除非用户在 GCS 中更改）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:42
#: 2e6b4c43cde141a796f33c32c3a96f8d 8ce65b563bc946ff95a5d7b3e4a1cacc
#: b82c97de4e5146f6ade18e5409b0163f c608f86a15d04ec7a08f63908d4e99ad
msgid ""
"The mount's default mode on startup can be set with the "
":ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>` parameter."
msgstr "云台开机时的默认模式可通过 :ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>` 参数设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:44
#: 1f96e7253bf64ce1b835f090a5aadbab 378edbc21139443fa8ef677702ad5bc7
#: 56f38bfa00b44c2eae3312550b693d1a bf09864da88d404fb32e23f392ff0bb5
msgid ""
"ArduPilot 4.5 (and higher) automatically switches the mount to RC Targeting "
"Mode if the pilot moves any configured Roll/Pitch/Yaw RC targeting inputs "
"(see below) by the larger of 10uS or ``RCx_DZ``.  The only exception is if "
"the mounts is in RETRACT mode in which case the mount mode will not be "
"automatically changed."
msgstr ""
"如果飞手将任一已配置的横滚/俯仰/偏航 RC 目标指向输入（见下文）移动超过 10uS 或 ``RCx_DZ`` 两者中的较大值，ArduPilot "
"4.5（及更高版本）会自动将云台切换到 RC 目标指向模式。唯一的例外是云台处于收起（RETRACT）模式，此时云台模式不会被自动更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:47
#: 3f35c0d8e94f4a4d90bc3ff733bbbfff 60a0104de2ef4f22b3d473174aa1865a
#: e928a42e523c4970a403695adbeb499f f341fdfc9c8e42919aa3a7fe9eae0595
msgid "Mount Internal Axis Locks"
msgstr "云台内部轴锁定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:48
#: 3d6c247f6ae74bf3850a0e09deb6bc12 e0149fb73e294471849b5d539d5baa9d
#: ee198df82b124fa895c6ab984c21697d ffffd294f91c4a2894a1d2f6859973ad
msgid ""
"The above modes concern how pitch, roll, and yaw axis *TARGETs* are sent to "
"the mount. But many mounts have internal controls for how those targets for "
"pitch, roll, and yaw are interpreted. Those positioning commands can be "
"interpreted by the mount as being with respect to Earth frame reference or "
"Body frame. Body frame are angle targets on each axis measured with respect "
"to the mount itself, while Earth frame is interpreted to be with respect the"
" horizon and compass heading."
msgstr ""
"上述模式涉及俯仰、横滚和偏航轴的 *目标* "
"如何发送给云台。但许多云台内部可以控制如何解读这些俯仰、横滚和偏航目标。云台可以将这些定位命令解读为相对于地球坐标系（Earth "
"frame）或机体坐标系（Body frame）。机体坐标系是相对于云台自身测量的各轴角度目标，而地球坐标系则是相对于地平线和罗盘航向解读的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:50
#: 27740388039440ed98a3253026b95f5f 4be236df95ca4b66b6bedd6e16e091f9
#: 567754b09653458d9165fc8537963fd3 7a7ee17d9d434922a0a9036bb792fb12
msgid ""
"For example, at 30 deg negative pitch target would be 30 deg down from the "
"mount's zero point with respect to its mounting in Body frame, but 30 deg "
"below the earth's horizon in Earth frame."
msgstr "例如，俯仰目标为负 30 度时，在机体坐标系下是相对于云台安装零点向下 30 度，而在地球坐标系下则是低于地平线 30 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:52
#: 0b396632f8c24575ad3cec782c5bf7af 23c692a297f24f45938b032bfdcff403
#: 367bc3c484f9493298125c8580da473b a7bbe804cef743ec881596d1eac6d15c
msgid ""
"Most mounts have internal controls for each axis to determine how to "
"interpret the targets. ArduPilot sets the mount's pitch and roll axis frame "
"(if configurable) to Earth frame interpretations for all Mount types via its"
" driver."
msgstr ""
"大多数云台的各轴都有内部控制，决定如何解读目标。ArduPilot 通过其驱动将所有云台类型的俯仰和横滚轴坐标系（如可配置）设为按地球坐标系解读。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:54
#: 5c1d06d1eb8e4d05899b9b03f62bba6f 9920b474cc644040a7be1bb31e2f9528
#: a62b9cdc748c4a15a1bf483a68e87914 b59fa86de0b849ab856fd8ab5d25a1bd
msgid ""
"The yaw axis is forced to Earth frame for the GPS Point, Home, and SysID "
"modes, and is otherwise body frame controlled."
msgstr "在 GPS 点指向、Home 和 SysID 模式下，偏航轴强制为地球坐标系；其他情况下按机体坐标系控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:57
#: 46a1dbbe72764995b032285a1278c078 8fd8b7a7373944b78a2c8691e76ec264
#: fb0a5b29fc6244a794d274deea875005 fb6fa50cd7dd49d7a669e75706fc6785
msgid "Mount RC failsafe position"
msgstr "云台 RC 失控保护位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:58
#: 1cae36bb058d436ea400360fcae90f9f 4565a0550e2c4323a0b106c5103c0a57
#: 9dff1a5ece3746329514841ef3fc8009 f9d02ff22a3a4369a4f242e02832e50a
msgid ""
"In the event of an RC failsafe, the mount can be moved to the Neutral mode "
"position if the ``MNTx_OPTIONS`` bit 1 is set."
msgstr "发生 RC 失控保护时，如果置位了 ``MNTx_OPTIONS`` 的位 1，云台可移动到中立模式位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:62
#: 510b143441c04b0a90324f1bea8b1615 7904d3b8797f411e985b013860773728
#: a589627297b741d793fe775a22388a43 de9fcea4995f47d09db1e081dd49e9c3
msgid ""
"While the mount is in \"RC Targeting\" mode (see above for how to change "
"modes), the pilot can control the mount's target roll, pitch and yaw angles "
"using an RC transmitter channel for each axis. For example (RC channels "
"shown are for example only, and can be any channel not otherwise used):"
msgstr ""
"当云台处于“RC 目标指向”模式时（如何切换模式见上文），飞手可以使用遥控器为每个轴分配一个通道，控制云台的目标横滚、俯仰和偏航角度。例如（所示 RC "
"通道仅为示例，可使用任何未被占用的通道）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:64
#: 01ed44757bb24ca8bd8c14a15200ef54 12d50d0521d5484cb81b1a31d7027b94
#: a762fae86c244607bc9a7ebc0ade4db2 d2acac42c5a84e21b123c6f8ddc23521
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 212 (\"Mount1 Roll\") to control the "
"mount's roll angle with RC channel 6"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 212（“Mount1 Roll”），用 RC 通道 6 控制云台横滚角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:65
