#: 87b602431f11462da1acd339a34c51f2 e7132b0347bb4f63814e9565ab646597
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount1 Pitch\") to control the "
"mount's pitch angle with RC channel 7"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 213（“Mount1 Pitch”），用 RC 通道 7 控制云台俯仰角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:66
#: 627f5c61496a4518bf0b85eb7023965c 63bb485047bb481a9edc5ca90f5e72fa
#: 9da639fa523b45d9bdda14a64a79ee20 f8ae5702e71d4c17b33a51261b5bf477
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount1 Yaw\") to control the "
"mount's yaw angle with RC channel 8"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 214（“Mount1 Yaw”），用 RC 通道 8 控制云台偏航角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:69
#: 47fe964aaf6846288afa005528ba6149 736207ebe1fe4e07b5b1aed0e3b60caf
#: 7ff1c0d0d1af412696a586ec8598f50c b11e052004b54eec911bac927129806a
msgid ""
"By default the RC input specifies the **angle** but this can be changed to "
"**rate** control by setting :ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to a **non-"
"zero** desired rotation rate in deg/sec."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下 RC 输入指定的是 **角度**，但可以通过将 :ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` 设为 **非零** "
"的期望旋转速率（度/秒）改为 **速率** 控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:71
#: 9ce28d0ac31443cd88a2ad9700f2c4c7 cc6c1d8a751c41079fa17fcb95249821
#: dc3d8d7f6cf24afe891bb32f4bd89516 f5a2b0081d8f4ffd9d2900a24fb75491
msgid ""
"The pilot can retract the mount with the \"Retract Mount1\" or \"Retract "
"Mount2\" auxiliary switch (using RC 10 in the below example.)"
msgstr "飞手可以使用“Retract Mount1”或“Retract Mount2”辅助开关收起云台（下例使用 RC 通道 10）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:73
#: 3bab02d690954c44a18eded324663dc7 ad2502b0553547c2af2271ecd9489f57
#: c029ae8de1fe4f22b2c63bd4ae118744 de8a612b09f84637a2eddf279753eee7
msgid ""
":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 27 (\"Retract Mount1\") to change the "
"mount to Retract mode"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 27（“Retract Mount1”），将云台切换到收起模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:74
#: 204543be638a4be78a10940915d302e0 34cca7aacb43417989c55a6e364ca4b9
#: a9a04d4c7ff144518b0e062f4a37a93e e1545ca55e704f6c9e079fb8881612e4
msgid ""
":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 113 (\"Retract Mount2\") to change the "
"mount to Retract mode"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 113（“Retract Mount2”），将云台切换到收起模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:77
#: 398cd47d7e7f4910970ac7528d2cda0b 4777d2592bf84208adc08da53156d315
