msgid "Axis Lock Auxiliary Switches and Options"
msgstr "轴锁定辅助开关与选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:79
#: 23b14642121d4733a4a0ac14f8b734b7 5d13305f73d9476d9eca7b64f89963ba
#: 8d8465ab21944703b9b9336cc4b399d0 e0d5ca1f567a48df97c4a2fb6169cc82
msgid ""
"If the mount is capable, the roll and pitch axes can be controlled in the RC"
" Targeting mode with an auxiliary switch on an RC channel, if you use ANGLE,"
" not RATE controls (eg. :ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` = 0. In the "
"future this will be expanded to RATE control also). For example using RC "
"channel 9, set :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 185 to enable this switch. "
"Switching its position will force roll and/or pitch angles of the mount to "
"be stabilized ('locked\") in earth frame (ie with respect to the horizon) or"
" body frame (with respect to the gimbals base)"
msgstr ""
"如果云台支持，在 RC 目标指向模式下可通过某个 RC 通道上的辅助开关控制横滚和俯仰轴，前提是使用角度（ANGLE）而非速率（RATE）控制（即 "
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` = 0。未来还将扩展到速率控制）。例如使用 RC 通道 9，设置 "
":ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 185 "
"启用该开关。切换其位置将强制云台的横滚和/或俯仰角在地球坐标系（即相对于地平线）或机体坐标系（相对于云台基座）中增稳（“锁定”）"

