#: 24da5c9a0a90458fbaafed299d441a7e 72d5c0e52f054e5f8feb2b74163681cd
msgid ""
"If Terrain is enabled and data available, you can lock the gimbal target to "
"a POI that it is pointing at and track it with the gimbal as the vehicle "
"moves using a transmitter Aux Function switch (eg. "
":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = \"186\") or via GCS Aux Function "
"activation. The AUX FUNC values:"
msgstr ""
"如果启用了地形（Terrain）且数据可用，可以将云台目标锁定到其正指向的 POI，并在载具移动时用云台跟踪它，方法是使用遥控器辅助功能开关（例如 "
":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = “186”）或通过 GCS 激活辅助功能。AUX FUNC 取值："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:104
#: 2a667c68bd4942a3a0ccad0b19817aee 408c89ddee1d47d989a24a820c64f0c3
#: 61da8a0ff690438a853f48bf48a1ef1f 6ac9c116c2e04df7b9947c6647cc0ed3
msgid ""
"The ground location that the gimbal is pointing at is recorded (POI "
"location) if it is currently clear and gimbal is switched to GPS Point "
"targeting mode. The gimbal's entry mode is recorded also. If the POI "
"location has already been recorded, then the mode is just switched back to "
"GPS Point to track the POI target."
msgstr ""
"如果当前 POI 位置为空，则记录云台正指向的地面位置（POI 位置），并将云台切换到 GPS 点指向模式。云台进入时的模式也会被记录。如果 POI "
"位置已被记录，则只是将模式切换回 GPS 点指向以跟踪 POI 目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:105
#: 4386bd37184d491fa979c1c81c0e6e13 5254bb208080458484b1bb326a92ccfe
#: 575d9ff8b8a74a07ae4c8c6bec3c2fb4 b150f441ef1d4c4fbb83283cee6181c9
msgid ""
"If the POI location is set, then gimbal mode is reverted to the above saved "
"mode to allow navigation, etc. but POI location is retained. Otherwise, no "
"action."
msgstr "如果已设置 POI 位置，则云台模式恢复为上面保存的模式，以便进行导航等操作，但 POI 位置会保留。否则不执行任何操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:106
#: 3150cddf5f9249e097c706df88c0e080 49bae69a12d347bcbdad0c6e63167a5b
#: 86c526b53391471b872c30e9480548bd f6087b4ef12d4ae7b0873ee6c6335502
msgid ""
"POI location is cleared and gimbal targeting mode set to its default mode "
"(eg. :ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>`)"
msgstr ""
"清除 POI 位置，并将云台目标指向模式设为其默认模式（例如 :ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:109
#: 0b1481da319b47529e3a5f06ca713d82 37f4a508d34d4443af82d8c2ee1b4ac9
#: 3da97d3585c0474491046e31af2152ae b96034233ccd4023a0af2139ecfa81a4
msgid ""
"in order for this to be accurate, the mount's "
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN<MNT1_PITCH_MIN>`, :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX<MNT1_YAW_MAX>`, "
"and :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN<MNT1_YAW_MIN>` must accurately reflect the gimbal's "
"EARTH FRAME angle extremes while in the vehicle's normal attitude when "
"function is activated (usually Plane in cruise, Copter in hover, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"为保证准确，云台的 "
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>`、:ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN<MNT1_PITCH_MIN>`、:ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX<MNT1_YAW_MAX>`"
" 和 :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN<MNT1_YAW_MIN>` "
"必须准确反映功能激活时载具处于正常姿态（通常固定翼为巡航、多旋翼为悬停等）下云台在地球坐标系中的角度极限"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:111
#: 0d23fd2efecb4b02a470b2642876e962 1e2d35ce890e434995faef787d82222f
#: 722b7995cd7e4061a05e8282ab58e63b a75c07d4369342889748d0c2fd43a623
msgid ""
"This feature and gimbal drivers are NOT normally included on standard "
"firmware for smaller flash (F4) boards. Use the `Custom Firmware Build "
"Server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ to create firmware that includes"
" it."
msgstr ""
"此功能和云台驱动通常不包含在较小 flash（F4）板的标准固件中。请使用 `Custom Firmware Build Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ 生成包含该功能的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:114
#: 1c4304dcda034e7d955483899c990094 3a88e6f0aa1645bbb2b45c925b9089b7
#: b7b84f4740f9430eb5028815c02835de bc99739926ef4a11bf6a7a103f11424d
msgid "POI Altitude"
msgstr "POI 高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:115
#: 0184515dc89a4e64bb1ae17f5ffa6222 6d80041937cb4f5f868cfdb143825c9b
#: e67f00825d6b4937a911bdeb19a2f295 ee9247f5a992440da04cad7e17e7e38c
msgid ""
"If Terrain data is enabled and available, the gimbal's \"boresight\" POI "
"will be set to whatever terrain elevation it is pointing. If not, the HOME "
"altitude will be used for the POI point."
msgstr "如果启用了地形数据且可用，云台“视轴”POI 将设为其所指向位置的地形高程。否则，POI 点将使用 HOME 高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:118
#: 1c2f7905239046b6b30b2b76a98e2e28 3277f7139c804690af1ad6eeda330fc9
#: 3aaef2251d144e8fb1d10be097fae184 3b55eb0a79fe49519b31e350f923e2bb
msgid "Mission Planner Mount Controls"
msgstr "Mission Planner 云台控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:119
#: 37521370e53d471bbb89164aa753aa52 6eb7ba8448d04c4c96c9e8707680d1de
#: f36c74a8b1de4687ac6829db3a54ffe3 f6c86d1ba0524020a25998f471411eac
msgid ""
"Mission Planner uses MAVLink commands to control the mount.  The mount's "
"angles can be controlled as follows"
msgstr "Mission Planner 使用 MAVLink 命令控制云台。云台角度可按如下方式控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:122
#: 36379bd1fb4045a0ae97aad012f2e59e 9251bb0c0cbe49b8a90831d173156f27
#: aef4a0ebba2d43eb870875d7efcee577 e634f20e4644462f89d75233a95ee423
msgid ""
"Use the Payload Control tab to adjust the mount's roll, pitch or yaw angles"
msgstr "使用 Payload Control（载荷控制）选项卡调整云台的横滚、俯仰或偏航角"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:133
#: 1103d0167b0b4ce8b4517e859b1aa008 7d32859f35664fa88ac8dcd1e4eb7928
#: 804c98e18fa3446cac604c95fe81cbf1 d1ab57cb6435432ba3513401f3f7d3a0
msgid ""
"To point the mount at a particular location (e.g. lat, lon, alt), on the "
"Data screen, right-mouse-button click on the map and select, \"Point Camera "
"Here\" and enter an altitude above home"
msgstr ""
"要使云台指向特定位置（例如纬度、经度、高度），在 Data 界面的地图上单击鼠标右键，选择 “Point Camera "
"Here”（将相机指向此处）并输入相对 Home 的高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:139
#: 36f6a48ce6294fd9b736c833c4299464 a9fb59205d7a421f9aff1bc53852ef55
#: aaf504a4674c4c38b89bee9dfcd3fbe6 e1f92cc2092a4719ac8c5dd2d855523d
msgid "QGC Mount Controls"
msgstr "QGC 云台控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:140
#: 0591e163612c4e16baf26efaee72b556 7bb1873c94204375938c495702ed3fdc
#: cabb9633b89c4867aa2b82c14da286c7 dba6cffa90de479c91c135a656d78b85
msgid ""
"`QGC-4.4 (and higher) "
"<https://github.com/mavlink/qgroundcontrol/releases>`__ supports controlling"
" the mount from a Toolbar or by directly clicking on the real-time video.  "
"The vehicle must be using ArduPilot 4.5 (or higher)"
msgstr ""
"`QGC-4.4（及更高版本） <https://github.com/mavlink/qgroundcontrol/releases>`__ "
"支持通过工具栏或直接点击实时视频来控制云台。载具必须运行 ArduPilot 4.5（或更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:142
#: 128bc08be906473abbde45c3222de6a8 78f78acfd0e642348727b978edc06cb3
#: c92acf1a096c4227983fa76dc6aa5eeb f5975fd2003d4d15bef7ee361c86cda4
msgid ""
"The mount control toolbar should appear at the top once a mount is detected."
"  Click on the toolbar to display the mount control buttons"
msgstr "检测到云台后，云台控制工具栏应出现在顶部。点击工具栏可显示云台控制按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:147
#: 511942ca1f69466dba5f5341d51451c6 6ccfaabca3d54365b01cfdacd75c8f67
#: ab5ce0f7698f4c0b969f2fc7d9eca24c d998a481a3e7452a9753b6b92b021522
msgid ""
"\"Yaw Lock\" / \"Yaw Follow\" controls whether the mount maintains an earth-"
"frame yaw target (aka \"lock\") or moves with the vehicle's yaw (aka "
"\"follow\")"
msgstr ""
"“Yaw Lock”/“Yaw Follow”（偏航锁定/偏航跟随）控制云台是保持地球坐标系偏航目标（即“锁定”），还是随载具偏航移动（即“跟随”）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:148
#: 4d413afca31f4f5d86cfbccd7a5ce57f 54cfb546dd1943f4aa997259cc68712a
#: 8258cd9d89cd41b3b00f535634b920a5 b51b3df1f0a44ea887587bf0852569a9
msgid ""
"\"Center\" centers the mount (or more precisely moves it to the roll, pitch "
"and yaw angles held in :ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`)"
msgstr ""
"“Center”（居中）使云台回中（更准确地说，移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_X<MNT1_NEUTRAL_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z<MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z>`"
" 中保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:149
#: 5451b81ddcf14d9d9d0cd3e011dfc7a3 719b27d9f8ba4b728ccae5740cca7d49
#: ab4468c6efd2421fb25cfa7f9d6d919e acb2379e5f0e4e818297fa4bfc66e362
msgid "\"Tilt 90\" points the mount directly downwards"
msgstr "“Tilt 90” 使云台垂直向下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:150
#: 342b9a9914954393b250ff8d2cffed41 364cc281fd9747d29e6722b2667ee33d
#: 51d42457953c494ab142072491ed5df7 7a6a7389a9b24e59b8e1a21a67fcf421
msgid "\"Point Home\" points the mount at the home location"
msgstr "“Point Home” 使云台指向 Home 位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:151
#: 0e2f8956cf6f4f618ea73b41782cefd0 5574195bdbc74215833276aed4390cd2
#: 7a6bf32ec9c3474c84010b99012c61a2 f7767924e0ce4445867de017382edb4b
msgid ""
"\"Retract\" retracts the mount (or more precisely moves it to the roll, "
"pitch and yaw angles held in :ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`, "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`)"
msgstr ""
"“Retract”（收起）收起云台（更准确地说，移动到 "
":ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_X<MNT1_RETRACT_X>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Y<MNT1_RETRACT_Y>`、:ref:`MNT1_RETRACT_Z<MNT1_RETRACT_Z>`"
" 中保存的横滚、俯仰和偏航角度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:153
#: 0958d2fac3b74803ae3fff53c33fc5bc 60e8243c31c944a497ee37ed595f5c83
#: 7857e192ec10418496547aebed8c09e5 8e49230369484dcc929e8e1b46ebb851
msgid ""
"The mount may also be controlled by clicking on the real-time video screen"
msgstr "也可以通过点击实时视频画面来控制云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:158
#: 3f60a150594841a687728b6ad7a6deca 608b7d708a5f4650a3013f641e8c02e4
#: b70c27394ece4fc0993f852252dd5791 c3341219bdab44578438fa37594fd238
msgid ""
"Maximise the real-time video and click anywhere on the screen and the mount "
"should move appropriately"
msgstr "将实时视频最大化，点击画面任意位置，云台应相应移动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:163
#: 1c080f5ecae74027afb455bfdfdab181 8df94a46f5c347d892a078ecac28af49
#: c2a1ecf73d7a41eaafb05f258d673a8f c3268a15b74542518ee229a888eab507
msgid "To point the mount at a Location"
msgstr "使云台指向某个位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:167
#: 3a9fa31615cf49f6a462d84239e97198 88840f59d2f1404faf78821169f4e853
#: cd164570aa5a44529c5217b9b1cd36a3 ed70598d16254c0f828b3a11f2b6c9ed
msgid ""
"To stop pointing at the location, click on the \"ROI here\" icon and select "
"\"Cancel ROI\".  The mount will return to the mode held in the "
":ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>` parameter"
msgstr ""
"要停止指向该位置，点击 “ROI here” 图标并选择 “Cancel ROI”。云台将返回 "
":ref:`MNT1_DEFLT_MODE<MNT1_DEFLT_MODE>` 参数中保存的模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:173
#: 7869676ba776466d8ad958ad072a7aa0 814fb9fcc0ea41fba116ee90a6c85dc3
#: 899ff2ac705541078c241f567c65905b a5553753cd844bd3bf91ae9d691f18c2
msgid "Companion Computer mount Controls"
msgstr "协同计算机云台控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:181
#: 19e00e8bd66143bc94c37dc00943b7a3 9a7096128d8945fdb964cd67626ecaad
#: d9accf8dcd314375b256578359ad3baf f2f95fbc1d22402d91851a17551fbb36
msgid ""
"Commands to control the mount are listed on the  :ref:`Camera Control in "
"Auto Missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`,"
" :ref:`Copter Mission Command List <mission-command-list>` and :ref:`Mission"
" Commands <common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` pages"
msgstr ""
"控制云台的命令列于 :ref:`自动任务中的相机控制 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-"
"mission-planner>`、:ref:`Copter 任务命令列表 <mission-command-list>` 和 :ref:`任务命令 "
"<common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd>` 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:184
#: 35e527f7682444ba9f8a4b3e0b5a0ebf 76c1d301c452403b81796cd1b00a04c4
#: 7c743f7d44014214bf3ae80520252d41 fe778314b9a34ae08c785380ad269f52
msgid "Other Mount Parameters"
msgstr "其他云台参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:185
#: 63fce4655eec468b82f205c576b57141 e40a14f1aa5e47db9c682ad4aa90c65d
#: ece46ad073074a7a9489bbd9b7d642d7 f1b3e25fa41341dbad2c315675e6050e
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX<MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` and :ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN<MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` "
"control the mount's roll axis movement range in degrees"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX<MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` 和 :ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN<MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` "
"控制云台横滚轴的活动范围（单位：度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:186
#: 1146c6614a6c4b83b13d4ea705b7e474 628aa112664b498c964b4cc59b0f0302
#: cb1025d9d7da4b94ba33d6abe75d55ce e5dcaef25b8142569bdf2c8ee3d8df02
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` and "
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN<MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` control the mount's pitch axis "
"movement range in degrees"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX<MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN<MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` 控制云台俯仰轴的活动范围（单位：度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:187
#: 854b77dd9142443683deee2f65def18a be94fc0eb9554a2f88ce6300da767558
#: cc88d0a81e324c1f865a7b6036819715 e5a4c5a1395d4ed8b1aa3880c759b43a
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX<MNT1_YAW_MAX>` and :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN<MNT1_YAW_MIN>` "
"control the mount's yaw axis movement range in degrees"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX<MNT1_YAW_MAX>` 和 :ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN<MNT1_YAW_MIN>` "
"控制云台偏航轴的活动范围（单位：度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:188
#: 3d7fe946b02b4ba5b1d526a5ebb80633 7a8242a678504207b674a0be5c24fe49
#: 808d3f8de552428889adb73af5c0bcd7 954f88fedb434bf48cd36edbd70aef46
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_OPTIONS<MNT1_OPTIONS>` bit 0 set will recover the yaw lock state "
"of the previous mode. For example if the mount's yaw lock was body frame in "
"RC Targeting mode and the mount mode switched to GPS Point (which forces "
"earth frame yaw) and then switched back to RC Targeting, the yaw would be "
"still earth frame unless this bit is set. Bit 1 set will force Neutral mode "
"in RC failsafe to possibly re-center the camera in failsafe when user "
"control has been lost. Bit 2 , in RC Targeting mode, force the roll and "
"pitch axes to lock to the gimbal's body frame for FPV operation (ie horizon "
"moves with vehicle roll and pitch in camera view)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`MNT1_OPTIONS<MNT1_OPTIONS>` 位 0 置位将恢复上一模式的偏航锁定状态。例如，若云台在 RC "
"目标指向模式下偏航锁定为机体坐标系，云台模式切换到 GPS 点指向（强制地球坐标系偏航）后再切回 RC "
"目标指向，除非置位该位，否则偏航仍为地球坐标系。位 1 置位将在 RC 失控保护时强制进入中立模式，以便在失去用户控制时使相机回中。位 2 在 RC "
"目标指向模式下强制横滚和俯仰轴锁定到云台机体坐标系，用于 FPV 操作（即相机画面中地平线随载具横滚和俯仰移动）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mount-targeting.rst:190
#: 016ebb1b185747d9b88b5d73b3e6e8eb 55cf2a460cf246af825540124a609ca9
#: 8fcf3f8c29dd4c018c18b1ea19faaf51 b8b77e6ab17445d5b99bf04a677459fd
msgid ""
"For MAVLink controlled mounts,the mount supplies its axes max and min "
"angles. The user can override these to limit the gimbal, but this alters the"
" defaults for those parameters and using a different MAVLink gimbal will NOT"
" use its communicated limits unless the entire autopilot parameters are "
"reset."
msgstr ""
"对于 MAVLink 控制的云台，云台会提供其各轴的最大和最小角度。用户可以覆盖这些值以限制云台，但这会更改这些参数的默认值；更换其他 MAVLink "
"云台时将不会使用其通告的限制，除非完整重置飞控参数。"
